# --- ReyOS additions: KDE Plasma live/install desktop ---
networkmanager
plasma-desktop
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
plasma-workspace
# qt6-base (pulled in transitively by KDE frameworks like kxmlgui/kconfig)
# depends on the virtual opengl-driver/libgl packages. Pin the plain
# open-source mesa/libglvnd explicitly so it resolves without an
# interactive "Enter a number" prompt if more than one provider is ever
# available -- matches what's already used on the dev/test VMs (virtio
# video, no GPU passthrough). Confirmed blocking mkarchiso 2026-08-11.
mesa
libglvnd
# Open-source Vulkan + video decode for every vendor (see reyos-gpu-detect). Shipping
# these also means a later `pacman -S steam` finds vulkan-driver already satisfied
# instead of pulling nvidia-utils as the default provider.
vulkan-intel
vulkan-radeon
vulkan-nouveau
intel-media-driver
libva-intel-driver
# Realtime scheduling for PipeWire (audio stutter under load, emulation).
rtkit
sddm
# sddm's Depends are Qt6-only, but the breeze greeter theme needs Qt5
# QML (libQt5Quick/Qml/Network/Gui/Core) -- qt5-declarative is only an
# *optional* dep of sddm, so pacman never pulls it in on its own.
# Without it the greeter binary fails to exec (dynamic linker can't
# resolve those libs) and sddm crash-loops with "exited with 127" --
# confirmed live on the dev VM 2026-08-11, ldd showed all 5 as "not found".
qt5-declarative
kwin
konsole
dolphin
dolphin-plugins
kate
ark
okular
gwenview
